  "Deal Psy damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK (2 hits). There is a <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> base chance to inflict <link=\"s|114\"><u>[Sight]</u></link> on the main target with and a <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> base chance to inflict <link=\"s|114\"><u>[Sight]</u></link> on all other foes. Then convert <link=\"s|114\"><u>[Sight]</u></link> on foes into <link=\"s|114\"><u>[Sight]</u></link> on Haru. Lasts for $4 turns; Gain [Thermal Customization]: When using a Gun Attack, if Haru has <link=\"s|114\"><u>[Sight]</u></link>, increase <link=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color>. After the Gun Attack, remove all <link=\"s|114\"><u>[Sight]</u></link> granted to Haru.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The colorful swirls of color confuse the foe's mind, and the swirls continue to spin like a dream, dragging the group into the set traps and dealing Psy damage.</color></size></b>": "",
