  "Deal Gun damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. When Haru has <link=\"s|114\"><u>[Sight]</u></link>, increase this skill's Pierce by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>; Gain [Piercing Customization]: When using a Gun Attack, deal bonus Psy damage to the main target equal to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK (can gain <link=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> increases from [Thermal Customization]).\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Elegant as ever, see the black hole in the muzzle, that's the foe's countdown to death, aim then deal Gun damage.</color></size></b>": "",
