  "<size=26>Full Metal Explosion <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Deal Psy damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. When Haru has <link=\"s|114\"><u>[Sight]</u></link>, increase this skill's Crit Rate by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>; Gain 1 [Spreading Customization]: When using a Gun Attack, deal bonus Psy damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK (can gain <link=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> increases from [Thermal Customization]).\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Awaken the nightmares in your foes' hearts and stare into their fears, dealing Psy damage to all foes.</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Deal Psy damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. Gain [Overload Customization] if Haru doesn't have [Overload Customization] and is below maximum [Customization]. [Overload Customization]: When using a Gun Attack, increase Crit Rate by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>. Otherise, increase this <link=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color>.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Psy damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe.\\nGun Attack: Deal Psy damage to all foes. Grant effects to Gun Attack via [Customization].": "",
  "During battle, for every $1 Ailment ACC, increase ATK by $2, up to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> ATK;\\nFor every $4 Ailment ACC, additionally gain 1 $5 Crit DMG stack. Stacks up to <color=#FFFC40>$6</color> times.": "",
  "During battle, for every $1 Ailment ACC, increase ATK by $2, up to <color=#0169ca>$3</color> ATK;\\nFor every $4 Ailment ACC, additionally gain 1 $5 Crit DMG stack. Stacks up to <color=#0169ca>$6</color> times.": "",
  "For every 1 Customization gained, permanently gain 1 [Barrel Heat] stack. Increase Haru's stats based on the number of [Barrel Heat] stacks:\\n1 stack: Increase Ailment ACC by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> and Ailment RES by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>;\\n2 stacks: Increase ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> and DEF by <color=#FFFC40>$4</color>;\\n3 stacks: Increase Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color>.": "",
  "For every 1 Customization gained, permanently gain 1 [Barrel Heat] stack. Increase Haru's stats based on the number of [Barrel Heat] stacks:\\n1 stack: Increase Ailment ACC by <color=#0169ca>$1</color> and Ailment RES by <color=#0169ca>$2</color>;\\n2 stacks: Increase ATK by <color=#0169ca>$3</color> and DEF by <color=#0169ca>$4</color>;\\n3 stacks: Increase Crit DMG by <color=#0169ca>$5</color>.": "",
  "After using [Full Metal Explosion], restore $1 of the spent SP, if [Customization] is not full, gain 1 new [Customization] (prioritize [Overload Customization] > [Thermal Customization] > [Piercing Customization]).\\nFor every 1 [Customization], increase Haru's ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> and Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color>.": "",
  "After using [Full Metal Explosion], restore $1 of the spent SP, if [Customization] is not full, gain 1 new [Customization] (prioritize [Overload Customization] > [Thermal Customization] > [Piercing Customization]).\\nFor every 1 [Customization], increase Haru's ATK by <color=#0169ca>$2</color> and Crit DMG by <color=#0169ca>$3</color>.": "",
  "Before the end of turn, if Haru has maxed [Customization], automatically use Gun Attack.\\nFor every 1 [Sight], increase Haru's Skill Damage by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> + $2 * Haru's Awareness level, up to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> + $4 * Haru's Awareness level.\\nWhen using a Gun Attack, increase Haru's Total DMG Amp by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> + $6 * Haru's Awareness level and DMG Bonus by <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> + $8 * Haru's Awareness level.": "",
  "Before the end of turn, if Haru has maxed [Customization], automatically use Gun Attack.\\nFor every 1 [Sight], increase Haru's Skill Damage by <color=#0169ca>$1</color> + $2 * Haru's Awareness level, up to <color=#0169ca>$3</color> + $4 * Haru's Awareness level.\\nWhen using a Gun Attack, increase Haru's Total DMG Amp by <color=#0169ca>$5</color> + $6 * Haru's Awareness level and DMG Bonus by <color=#0169ca>$7</color> + $8 * Haru's Awareness level.": "",
