  "r:\"^Deal\\\\s+Gun\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+foe\\\\s+equal\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+of\\\\s+Attack\\\\.\\\\s*When\\\\s+Haru\\\\s+has\\\\s+<link\\=\"s\\\\|114\"><u>Target\\\\s+Audience</u></link>,\\\\s+increase\\\\s+this\\\\s+skill's\\\\s+pierce\\\\s+rate\\\\s+by\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+and\\\\s+gain\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+Painpoint\\\\s+Round\\\\.\\\\nPainpoint\\\\s+Round:\\\\s+When\\\\s+using\\\\s+a\\\\s+ranged\\\\s+attack,\\\\s+also\\\\s+deal\\\\s+Psychokinesis\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+the\\\\s+main\\\\s+target\\\\s+equal\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+of\\\\s+Attack\\\\s+\\\\(can\\\\s+gain\\\\s+skill\\\\s+damage\\\\s+increases\\\\s+from\\\\s+Focused\\\\s+Round\\\\)\\\\.\\\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Fires\\\\s+a\\\\s+barrage\\\\s+of\\\\s+shots\\\\s+at\\\\s+a\\\\s+target\\\\s+in\\\\s+your\\\\s+sights,\\\\s+dealing\\\\s+Gun\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+a\\\\s+foe\\\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Deal\\\\s+Psychokinesis\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+all\\\\s+foes\\\\s+equal\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+of\\\\s+Attack\\\\.\\\\s*When\\\\s+Haru\\\\s+has\\\\s+<link\\=\"s\\\\|114\"><u>Target\\\\s+Audience</u></link>,\\\\s+increase\\\\s+this\\\\s+skill's\\\\s+critical\\\\s+rate\\\\s+by\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+and\\\\s+gain\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+Spillover\\\\s+Round\\\\s+stack\\\\.\\\\nSpillover\\\\s+Round:\\\\s+When\\\\s+using\\\\s+a\\\\s+ranged\\\\s+attack,\\\\s+also\\\\s+deal\\\\s+Psychokinesis\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+all\\\\s+foes\\\\s+equal\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+of\\\\s+Attack\\\\s+\\\\(can\\\\s+gain\\\\s+skill\\\\s+damage\\\\s+increases\\\\s+from\\\\s+Focused\\\\s+Round\\\\)\\\\.\\\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Unleashes\\\\s+your\\\\s+thoughts\\\\s+at\\\\s+targets\\\\s+in\\\\s+your\\\\s+sights,\\\\s+dealing\\\\s+Psychokinesis\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+all\\\\s+foes\\\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Highlight：Deal\\\\s+Psychokinesis\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+all\\\\s+foes\\\\s+equal\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+of\\\\s+Attack\\\\.\\\\s*Gain\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+Overload\\\\s+Round\\\\s+if\\\\s+Haru\\\\s+doesn't\\\\s+have\\\\s+any\\\\s+Overload\\\\s+Round\\\\s+stacks\\\\s+and\\\\s+is\\\\s+below\\\\s+maximum\\\\s+Thoughtful\\\\s+Round\\\\s+stacks\\\\.\\\\nOverload\\\\s+Round:\\\\s+When\\\\s+using\\\\s+a\\\\s+ranged\\\\s+attack,\\\\s+increase\\\\s+critical\\\\s+rate\\\\s+by\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\.\\\\nIf\\\\s+Haru\\\\s+hasn't\\\\s+gained\\\\s+any\\\\s+Overload\\\\s+Round\\\\s+stacks,\\\\s+increase\\\\s+this\\\\s+skill\\\\s+damage\\\\s+by\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\.\\\\n1\\\\s+MORE：Deal\\\\s+Psychokinesis\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+foe\\\\.\\\\nMelee\\\\s+Attack：Deal\\\\s+Physical\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+foe\\\\.\\\\nRanged\\\\s+Attack：Deal\\\\s+Psychokinesis\\\\s+damage\\\\s+to\\\\s+all\\\\s+foes\\\\.\\\\s*Grant\\\\s+effects\\\\s+to\\\\s+ranged\\\\s+attacks\\\\s+via\\\\s+Thoughtful\\\\s+Round\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^During\\\\s+battle,\\\\s+increase\\\\s+Attack\\\\s+by\\\\s+(\\d+)%\\\\s+for\\\\s+every\\\\s+(\\d+\\\\.?\\d*)%\\\\s+of\\\\s+ailment\\\\s+accuracy\\\\s+\\\\(up\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+of\\\\s+Attack\\\\)\\\\.\\\\s*Also\\\\s+increase\\\\s+critical\\\\s+damage\\\\s+by\\\\s+(\\d+)%\\\\s+for\\\\s+every\\\\s+(\\d+)%\\\\s+of\\\\s+ailment\\\\s+accuracy\\\\s+\\\\(stacks\\\\s+up\\\\s+to\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\\\s+times\\\\)\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Permanently\\\\s+gain\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+Area\\\\s+to\\\\s+Improve\\\\s+stack\\\\s+for\\\\s+each\\\\s+(\\d+)\\\\s+Thoughtful\\\\s+Round\\\\s+stack\\\\s+gained\\\\.\\\\s*Gain\\\\s+the\\\\s+following\\\\s+effects\\\\s+based\\\\s+on\\\\s+the\\\\s+number\\\\s+of\\\\s+Area\\\\s+to\\\\s+Improve\\\\s+stacks\\\\.\\\\n(\\d+)\\\\s+stack:\\\\s+Increase\\\\s+ailment\\\\s+accuracy\\\\s+by\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+and\\\\s+ailment\\\\s+resistance\\\\s+by\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\.\\\\n(\\d+)\\\\s+stacks:\\\\s+Increase\\\\s+Attack\\\\s+by\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\s+and\\\\s+Defense\\\\s+by\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\.\\\\n(\\d+)\\\\s+stacks:\\\\s+Increase\\\\s+critical\\\\s+damage\\\\s+by\\\\s+<color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+\\.?\\d*)%</color>\\\\.$\"": "",
  "For Haru's ranged attacks, deal Psychokinesis damage to all foes equal to 66% of Haru's Attack. When using certain skills, gain 1 corresponding Thoughtful Round stack and reload. Up to 3 stacks of Thoughtful Round with different effects can be stacked at the same time.\\nFor each Thoughtful Round stack, grant unique effects to ranged attacks. When Haru uses a ranged attack, increase skill damage based on Thoughtful Round stacks (increase by 20%/40%/50% at 1/2/3 stacks, respectively). If at 2+ Thoughtful Round stacks, also increase Attack by 25%.\\nAfter using a ranged attack, remove all Thoughtful Round stacks.": "",
  "After a new foe appears, activate Extrasensory Aim for that foe at the start of Haru's next turn.\\nBased on Haru's <link\\=\"s|114\"><u>Target Audience</u></link> stacks, increase Attack by 8% (up to 24%) and ranged attack critical rate by 6% (up to 18%).": "",
  "When Haru has 1+ <link\\=\"s|114\"><u>Target Audience</u></link> stacks, decrease damage taken by 25%. When at 3+ Target Audience stacks, increase Psychokinesis damage by 60%.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Mindful Release and Thief Tactics by 3.": "",
  "Overload Round Enhanced: When using a ranged attack, increase critical damage by 30%.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Extrasensory Aim and Precise Volley by 3.": "",
  "When at 2+ Thoughtful Round stacks, evolve Haru's ranged attacks to Resonating Shots. Also, deal a ranged attack that activates all Thoughtful Round effects once. This additional attack's damage is 70% of the original attack. At 2+ Thoughtful Round stacks, activate the following effects for Thoughtful Round gained from skills.\\nFocused Round: When using a ranged attack, also decrease the foe's ailment resistance by 27% for 2 turns.\\nPainpoint Round: When using a ranged attack and Haru has <link\\=\"s|114\"><u>Target Audience</u></link>, increase pierce rate by 12%.\\nSpillover Round: When using a ranged attack and Haru has Target Audience, increase critical rate by 20% and critical damage by 20%.": "",
